            sh:in ( <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#FAMMEMB> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#CHILD> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#NCHILD> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#CHLDADOPT> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#DAUADOPT> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#SONADOPT> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#CHLDFOST> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#DAUFOST> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#SONFOST> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#DAUC> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#DAU> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#STPDAU> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#SON> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#SONC> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#STPSON> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#STPCHLD> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#EXT> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#AUNT> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#MAUNT> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#PAUNT> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#UNCLE> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#MUNCLE> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#PUNCLE> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#COUSN> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#MCOUSN> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#PCOUSN> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#NIENEPH> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#NEPHEW> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#NIECE> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#GGRPRN> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#GGRFTH> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/pers