/ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#FTWINBRO> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#FTWINSIS> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#SPS> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#HUSB> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#WIFE> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#FMRSPS> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#DOMPART> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#SIGOTHR> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#FRND> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#NBOR> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#ROOM> <https://ns.socialcaredata.io/person-relationship-code#ONESELF> ) ;
